# 17. Check Everything at Once

Run:

```bash
kubectl get all
```

You should see resources such as:

```text
NAME                                      READY
pod/web-app-deployment-xxxxx-xxxxx       1/1
pod/web-app-deployment-xxxxx-yyyyy       1/1
pod/web-app-deployment-xxxxx-zzzzz       1/1

NAME                      TYPE       CLUSTER-IP
