---

# 28. Roll Back the Application

Suppose Version 2 has a problem.

Roll back:

```bash
kubectl rollout undo deployment/web-app-deployment
```

Check:

```bash
kubectl rollout status deployment/web-app-deployment
```

Then refresh:

```text
http://localhost:30080
```

The application should return to the previous version.

